# izdock/tomcat component versions and checksums (single source of truth).
#
# Read by build/install.sh (inside the image build, via build/lib.sh load_versions),
# by the Gitea workflows (base image and tags of each variant) and by tools/make-updates.sh,
# which checks upstream and rewrites the values with --apply.
# Plain KEY=value lines only: no spaces, no quotes, no commands.
# Every *_SHA256 is the sha256 of the exact file that is downloaded.
# tools/make-updates.sh stays on the major version of each component: a new major is only reported.
# Pin: <NAME>_PIN=<version> next to a <NAME>_VER keeps that component on <version>
# (tools/make-updates.sh never moves it, and --apply sets it with its sha256).

## base images (one variant per Tomcat major) - https://hub.docker.com/_/tomcat
# the image is docker.io/library/tomcat:<VER>-<FLAVOR>@<DIGEST>: the digest pins the content,
# make-updates proposes a new digest also when the upstream tag is rebuilt (OS/JRE updates)
TOMCAT9_VER=9.0.123
TOMCAT9_FLAVOR=jre11-temurin-noble
TOMCAT9_DIGEST=sha256:7d8ae3489a97a31a8b8b9bdf079c11a6676c5a9084a489ac506fa73705fea5d4
TOMCAT10_VER=10.1.61
TOMCAT10_FLAVOR=jre17-temurin-noble
TOMCAT10_DIGEST=sha256:5a7f8f0f65e713681c73593c09caef9a1af8c80c9e868a699c5463aeaaecdbe1

